<title>PORTUGAL: EDP utility to join Lisbon BVL30 index.</title>
<headline>EDP utility to join Lisbon BVL30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of utility group EDP-Electricidade de Portugal will be included in the BVL30 index of leading shares as of July 1, a bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>On the same date EDP will also become part of the PSI20 index.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
